sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer (C-200)
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant G as Guardrails
    participant I as Intent agent
    participant R as Router
    participant L as Lookup agent
    participant P as Policy agent
    participant E as Execution agent
    participant A as Approval queue
    participant W as Response agent
    actor H as Support lead
    C->>O: "Refund ORD-1004, the monitor was defective"
    O->>G: validate_input
    G-->>O: allowed
    O->>I: classify + extract
    I-->>O: refund, ORD-1004, defective
    O->>R: route(refund)
    R-->>O: refund_workflow
    O->>L: verify_access + gather facts
    L-->>O: order, return received, no refund yet
    O->>P: check_refund_eligibility
    P-->>O: eligible, $350, requires_approval (R-4)
    O->>E: execute decision
    E->>A: request approval + high-priority ticket
    E-->>O: approval_required (APR-9001)
    O->>W: draft reply from fact sheet
    W->>G: validate_output
    W-->>O: reply with [ORD-1004] [POLICY R-4] [APR-9001]
    O-->>C: "A support lead must review it first..."
    H->>A: approve APR-9001
    A->>E: execute_approved
    E-->>H: refund_issued RF-6002
